# Maintainer: Jan Alexander Steffens (heftig) <heftig@archlinux.org>
# Contributor: Jan de Groot <jgc@archlinux.org>

# ALARM: Kevin Mihelich <kevin@archlinuxarm.org>
#  - remove pipewire-onnx package, onnxruntime makedepend, set -D onnxruntime=disabled
#
# Arch Linux ARM's PipeWire recipe (archlinuxarm/PKGBUILDs extra/pipewire at
# 1b902bd4b08f37ae3798a70ec597646a0c370b84, 1:1.6.10-1) for aarch64 with the
# Aurora patches that fedora-aurora carries on 1.6.9; they apply to 1.6.10
# unchanged. pkgrel 1.2 sorts above ALARM's 1 and [aurora] precedes [core] and
# [extra] in pacman.conf, so pacman keeps these packages even after ALARM moves
# to a newer PipeWire. Rebase the patches when this recipe moves to a new
# upstream release; drop each one when upstream carries it.

pkgbase=pipewire
